This sheet shows who approved which documents of release {{ version }}. The signature records under `DHF/approvals/` are the evidence; this sheet presents the ones that verify against the approvers list, each over the document's current hash. A document's hash is computed over the items it lists in the release manifest, not over the rendered file.

